OL,3,GNEWSAPPE scam leader who bought watches
OL,4,Aand cars jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of a personal protective
OL,7,Fequipment (PPE) scam who bought Rolex
OL,8,Fwatches and luxury cars after scamming
OL,9,Fcompanies out of millions of pounds
OL,10,Fduring the Covid-19 pandemic has been
OL,11,Fjailed.
OL,13,FJogesh Bhandari, 60, spent #126,000 on
OL,14,Fa Porsche and bought an Audi A5, a Land
OL,15,FRover Discovery and jewellery after
OL,16,Fpretending he could supply millions of
OL,17,Fboxes of nitrile gloves in the US and
OL,18,FGermany between late 2020 and early
OL,19,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
