OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPPE scam leader who bought watches
OL,4,Aand cars jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJogesh and Craig Morris, who helped
OL,7,Fwith the sham deals, were convicted of
OL,8,Fconspiracy to commit fraud by false
OL,9,Frepresentation and concealing and
OL,10,Ftransferring criminal property, at
OL,11,FLeicester Crown Court in July.
OL,13,FOn Friday, Jogesh was sentenced to
OL,14,Feight years in prison.
